sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Gateway as Realtime Gateway
    participant Worker as services/worker
    participant Push as FCM / APNs Push Engine
    participant Device as Recipient Device (Screen Off)

    Gateway->>Worker: Enqueue Opaque Push Event (Recipient Device Offline)
    Worker->>Push: Send High-Priority Silent Push (Opaque Event ID only, NO PLAINTEXT)
    Push->>Device: Deliver Push Notification
    Device->>Gateway: Wake Background Process & Connect Socket to Fetch Encrypted Payload
